## Interface: 16001, 120100, 120105
## Title: Blato Lexicon
## Notes: A lexicon of your journey and party features for a group of three friends on WoW Forever. Open it from the minimap button or with /blato
## Author: Bláto party (based on ForeverJournal by Ugge Zen and One More Quest by MadDadVibe)
## IconTexture: Interface/Icons/Spell_Nature_EarthElemental_Totem
## X-License: GPL-3.0
## Version: 0.3.2
## OptionalDeps: !ForeverData, !ForeverDataProtect
## SavedVariables: BJ_DB, BJ_Chars, BlatoPartyDB, BlatoLexiconErrors
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: BJ_DBC, BJ_Char
## AddonCompartmentFunc: BlatoLexicon_Toggle

